Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,continued.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, nia, nia, ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck me that bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yanine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what's gonna happen now? The police\Nwill come and make an accident report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be used to\Ngetting canceled by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it and focus on a new project.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only that were really the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A creep truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should treat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take one of those, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting crepes\Nthe other day for lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I saw this dork in baggy\Nsweatpants ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew, that's so nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once she got her crepe,\Nher back got all hunched up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she started nibbling\Non it like a hamster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fucking hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you eat like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should have to take a test\Nand earn the right to buy crepes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, did I really earn the\Nright to get a crepe? Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yanni! Hi! Hey!\NWait a sec! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind going over to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, crepe truck, 12 o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you liked crepes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You getting one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need money for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll treat you if you go and buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's the money then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strawberry, banana, ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I tag along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, there are a lot of ways to\Neat, but your way is fucking freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even lunchtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've already crossed off a\Nbiggie on the ol' chore list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking off the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, morning, Yanni.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen you up this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, if I ever want my\Nsister to come over again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to take the\Ntrash out like a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to tell me\Nwhat that bat is all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to give it a try, Yani?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I just added\Na new tour to my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it now, I feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, it's intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feeling, I can't get enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I just chug down some of\Nthe strong cat booze and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is strobing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna be wasted, you need Strong Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fired me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because of that\None mark on my record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just out here trying to do\Nbetter, trying to make a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they to crush my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only human. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Newsflash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, you're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let Yani Neko see\Nme in such an embarrassing state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, what the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you're fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I taking a nap outside or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fucking serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was playing SF6 and I\Nlost to some guy using Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He talked some shit and then\Nboom, total, and complete blur!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna tell me what\Nthat sigh is all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, don't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your sighs! Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just lay off the games for a while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't just tell\Nme to quit Slumfighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't turn your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are your thoughts\Non femboy furries?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Femboy furries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a beast folk guy and have\Nthem act, you know, feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in the same vein as Otoconico stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they can't be female.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a different thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why I wanted to get a\Nmale perspective. Male perspective?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they're cute,\Nthey're still guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not into that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise, surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Femme fur culture is new\Nterritory for me, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to create a femme\Nfur character for my next series.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided I should try to\Nlearn more about it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't slept in three days\Ntrying to come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to find that spark, that\Ninspiration to get my juices flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems to me you're being a little\Nhard on yourself, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Tatsuro and the\Nlandlord hanging out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a combo I\Ndidn't think I'd ever see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seen my sister around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shilla, I need to bore you\Nin my room for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a cute face,\Nso he's pulling it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you can always say no, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is it doing anything for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the outfit is a 10, I'm still\Na no-go with this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:08:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you mean I don't turn you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I worked really,\Nreally hard on my look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm all set. All\Nright, enough. Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, your arms are so thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you at the gym all\Nday, or is it the dojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you've got surprisingly\Nsoft skin, but no! I got...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love piggyback rides from gorillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you didn't break anything, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently the center of the Milky Way\Nsmells exactly like a shot of rum. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The landlord and that random\Nwoman need to get a room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kaoruko Otani. Otani?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the second wife of\Nyour landlord, Mr. Otani.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My second wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not totally against\Nthis new look, Shunran.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Shunran?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being so nice to my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, wait a minute,\Nwhat am I missing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just die, Shunran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest, I thought for you\Npretty much any Beast Folk would do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I didn't expect\Nyou to have standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men is where I draw the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what the hell do you mean\Nby any Beast Folk would do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get the Beast Folk\Napartment thing, nasty man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew, that's so perverted!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't know me, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you get me a start light?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to sit\Nhere and take this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A teacup chest plate is the icing on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super mega motor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock hard motor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weenie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm headed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And remember, the curry\Ntastes better heated up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm sure you already know\Nthis, but it's going to rain tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, is that... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you live in this building?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the station out front?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In front of the station? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost got run over by a truck\Nand I had to jump in and save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run over by a truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you again, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to carry those bags for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is full of nothing but booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who sends a child on a beer run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor kid must have deadbeat parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These parents need a talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm here with Aru.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess her parents aren't home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't quite Yanni-level\Nmessy, but it's pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing about this apartment\Nsays safe for children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're\Nabout to drink this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beer is for adults, beer is not for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if her parents don't buy her\Nany juice, so this is all she has?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When was the last time this\Ninnocent girl felt loved?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or had a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the smell of it, it's been\Na while since one of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.68,0:12:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, listen, I'll cook dinner\Nfor you tonight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I smell curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hey, Aruko, you\Nfixin' up some curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Imoko, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry for...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're so sorry, then get out,\Nwhich is what I'd say in my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's still a bit left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's Kansai, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Party! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:13:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a parent, it is your responsibility\Nto bathe and feed your child!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on, what in blazes\Nare you hollering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you miss that poor little\Ngirl's been all her time here alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any stability?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this flavor are crazy,\Njust run in your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rich from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for the secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jake and Smoke and Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that skimpy bathing suit\Nisn't too uncomfortable for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are your pubes\Nsticking out the sides?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think a little talent thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost done writing my novel that\NI want to submit for a competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I printed the whole thing\Nout and read through it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I realized, wait, this\Nstory is really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's written just fine. But the hero's\Nemotional beats end up falling flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really annoyed by how bad my ideas are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then I've been racking my brain\Ntrying to fix it… But I just feel… Stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that happens. I could\Nwrite about dungeon diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you do when\Nyou get writer's block?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you beat it a cool\Nvillainess is how you get past that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been in your position before\Nwith writer's block plenty of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may not be the best advice But\Nyou just keep going after school
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all I'd do is sit in\Nfront of my computer and think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's five hours and nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like no talent to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, it might\Nbe easier to just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really should stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I mean sitting in\Nfront of your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to get outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's one example.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get out the door and go take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While out walking, I might\Nsee something like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a couple who are\Nwalking while holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, they suddenly let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you see a kid who falls down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think, will he cry or won't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'll find a food\Ntruck selling yummy crepes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These random scenarios give me good ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though they're not\Nconnected to my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They stimulate the brain, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I've been wasting my time\Nsitting in front of my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call it a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, you have to wring your\Nbrain out like a soggy rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think and think until\Nyou can't think anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the place where the\Nideas will finally start coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who can get that deep in their\Nthoughts, they're not as common as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, you've got everything\Nyou need to be a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's got some stank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:15:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the fuuuuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does your body even make that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a cream puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cream puffs my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh god, I think I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to put this feeling into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're a manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't explain why you'd make a\Nminer wear a skimpy swimsuit in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's, uh, I guess you could\Nsay it's for research.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I gotta hold your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well… Someone looks\Ntired. I wonder why…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why every inch of my body is aching
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all day long i'm just digging a\Nbunch of holes and tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fill the holes rinse and repeat\Nthat's what you're doing for work
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therein lies the burden of civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its people are always working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ever see him do is sweep this damn\Nyard Doesn't look like work to me He
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is performing his duty as the landlord\NHe works to improve your living spaces
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look perturbed Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it isn't the local chimney\NJudging by your face I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say you spent all night\Ntorturing your lungs again Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what work are you doing today? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, little Miss Curious, not that\NI have to explain myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do my daily sweeping,\Nthen water the cabbages,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,share our weekly bulletin, and I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, today is especially light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually I have a lot more work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I forget, Yani Neko, you still\Nowe me last month's rent, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're working, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have too much free time,\Nyou'll turn into a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't want you to have\Ntoo much fuckin' free time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some fuckin' balls on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think messing with the\Nguy you owe rent to is smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanna make sure you\Ndon't become a slacker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, aren't you the big\Ndick boss man around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm the boss and I\Ngotta teach you a lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then class is in session,\Nyou deadbeat piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can die, Robbester!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this fucking bitch... Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Saiyans!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the fuck's going on out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like what I'm seeing, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this doesn't inspire\Nsexy sports manga, I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today on Hami Channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an epic battle between a Baldi and\Na Chimney only on my livestream!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of us working off tips around here\Nto try and get some sleep, assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna try throwing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yani! There you are. Real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a new story I posted on\NKakeyome that, I mean of course,
