Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's\Ndone here, chimney bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you, Nyado.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a sad sight to witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all toil away working\Nto achieve happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, does anyone look truly\Nsatisfied with life while working?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one was I drinking in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one was the ashtray?
