Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not trying to do all that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this have to be the last time\Nthe audience sees me that's so depressing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have, like, way\Nbetter luck than her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it should be smooth\Nsailing for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guessed right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My luck's good and my beer's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do to decide this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
